                // byte gathers per (row, cc) below sit at byte offsets
                // {16g+t4, 16g+8+t4} and {t4+4}, so one 128-bit fetch per key row
                // replaces 8 scalar LDG.U8 (4x fewer L1/L2 wavefronts; values are
